---
import Breadcrumbs from '@/components/Breadcrumbs.astro'
import Link from '@/components/Link.astro'
import PageHead from '@/components/PageHead.astro'
import { buttonVariants } from '@/components/ui/button'
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
import { cn } from '@/lib/utils'
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import cloud from '../../public/static/iza.jpg'
---

<Layout class="max-w-3xl">
  <PageHead slot="head" title="404" />

  <section
    class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-y-4 text-left"
  >
  <Image
          src={cloud}
          alt="iza"
          height={300}
          class="object-cover m-0"
        />
    <div class="max-w-md prose courier-prime-regular">
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-medium courier-prime-bold">Greetings, Agent Cupcake</h1>
      <p class="font-bold text-xl">
        A very Happy Birthday to you, from the team at HQ.
      </p>
        <p>
        But it's time to get back to work. The future of the world lies in your hands! <br><br>Here are your missions: 
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
        P.S you can click on any of the blanks to reveal the answer if it's too hard
        </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col text-left">
        <div class="ring bg text-foreground p-4 font-medium w-fit mb-8 rounded-md">
          <div class="border-b border-black">

            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold m-0 mb-2">
              Mission #1
            </h1>
            <h4>
              You are now standing at Pastalove. Solve the riddle to find your next point of interest.
            </h4>
          </div>
        <p class="mb-2">
          The students, tired and weary, drag themselves to their morning <span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 inline-block rounded-md"> classes</span>. <br><br>
          Most would agree, that in Spain, the sun-tanning women have the best <span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 inline-block rounded-md"> assses </span>. <br><br>
          To turn white sugar into brown, one simply adds <span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 inline-block rounded-md">molasses</span> <br><br>
          I have arms but no hands. I am hardworking, but people, ever-so-ungrateful, see right through me. I am <span class="bg-teal-600 text-teal-600 inline-block rounded-md"> a pair of glasses</span>
          <br><br>
          Solve the green blank, and on this street, find the store that sells that item, then head to your next clue.
        </p>
      </div>
        <div class="ring bg text-foreground p-4 font-medium w-fit  mb-8 rounded-md">
          <h1 class="text-xl font-bold m-0 mb-2">
            Mission #2
          </h1>
          <h4>
            Cross the street onto Canaletta street.
          </h4>
        <p class="mb-2">
          On this street, you will find your target. Solve the following number pattern. It is not completely random - what are some special numbers for you?
        </p>
        <p class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold">
         0, 29, 23, 52, 46, 75, 69, 98, 92, 121, 115, <span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 inline-block rounded-md"> 144 </span>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-2">
          From your answer, look at the right-most digit. Find the building with that number on this street. Walk in - keeping a low profile - and head to the restaurant.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-2">
          There is a table for two, under the codename <strong class="font-bold">Baobei klus</strong> <em>(that's chinese for baby)</em>. Enjoy, and remember: <br><br>Agent Cupcake <em>always</em> starts her meals with a <strong class="text-bold">beef tartare</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
        <div class="ring bg text-foreground p-4 font-medium w-fit mb-8 rounded-md">
          <h1 class="text-xl font-bold m-0 mb-2">
            Mission #3 (Another day)
          </h1>
          <h4>
            Agent Cupcake goes global
          </h4>
        <p class="mb-2">
          A mysterious friend you will encounter, in the land of the Sausager.
          <br><br>
          Upon first meeting he will present to you,
          <br><br>
          Clothing of the finest design. 
          <br><br>
          The code will be:
          <br><br>
        </p>
        
      </div>
      <div class="ring bg text-foreground p-4 font-medium w-fit mb-8 rounded-md">
          <h1 class="text-xl font-bold m-0 mb-2">
            Mission #4 (Another day)
          </h1>
          <h4>
            Agent Cupcake goes global, for real this time
          </h4>
        <p class="mb-2">
          Mission loading...
        </p>
        
      </div>
      <div>
      </div>
      
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script>
    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('span');
      for (let button of buttons) {
        button.addEventListener('click',
        () => {
          if (confirm("Are you sure you want to give up so easy? ;)") == true) {
              button.classList.remove("bg-blue-600")
              button.classList.remove("bg-teal-600")
            } else {
            }
          
        });
      }
  </script>
</Layout>
